We explore Flynn Reef for the final time of our liveaboard dive trip. Lochie and I gear up in opposing outfits, he's got hood, wetsuit, gloves, I've got hat, shirt, shorts. We are greeted by beautiful reef fish and another amazing day on the water. Forever grateful for each experience I get on the Great Barrier Reef.

## Dive stats

- **Location:** Flynn Reef, QLD
- **Date:** 22 June 2026
- **Depth:** Avg 8m, max 15m
- **Visibility:** 10-15m

## Highlights

Spotted unicornfish, various butterflyfish, rabbitfish, six-band angelfish and a couple big flowery cod.
